  "review": {
    "paper_id": "P077",
    "status": "selected_core_source_sections_reviewed",
    "summary": "CLIPort已追到Ravens/PyBullet的bowl／rope任務、示範讀寫與Task.reward/is_match。mean_reward可含部分分數；bowl文字目標與checker有一對一配對落差，且eval沒有按episode seed重設Python random，不能保證完全重建示範語義變體。",
    "identity_note": "固定論文為 Shridhar、Manuelli、Fox 的 CLIPort: What and Where Pathways for Robotic Manipulation，arXiv:2109.12098v1／CoRL 2021。PDF 的 code-availability 指向 cliport.github.io；倉庫 README 1–9 同時吻合題名、三位作者、arXiv 與專案網址，足以確認 cliport/cliport 為本論文官方程式。openai/CLIP 與 Ravens 是重用依賴，不能另算 CLIPort benchmark。",
    "discovery_evidence": [
      {
        "local_file": "audit/.cache/github_review/P077-discovery.json",
        "selected_json_pointers": [
          "/title",
          "/paper_url",
          "/pdf_sha256",
          "/code_contexts/1"
        ],
        "paper_version": "2109.12098v1",
        "pdf_sha256": "3cc19664beabda203cb1a1ad86659f75f60a099189820d92d59d20067c9ab003",
        "finding": "論文作者／版次與 benchmark、code availability 文字相符；README 交叉確認官方身份。",
        "sha256": "618eb5eed4f937847728c2982cba6e15040a5f984e1cbfb58cf7ea7e9c19c79f",
        "text_excerpts": [
          {
            "json_pointer": "/opening_text",
            "character_range": [
              860,
